        "Id": "68d88396-f4b5-41e8-9cbb-6e6a506d8b61",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Bugman",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK",
        "PublicId": "108445334684",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ee3f55b8-12f8-4245-8ef2-3022b4f6f120).Image",
        "Description": "Retrace a popular strategy used on Bangkok for particularly difficult spins named &quot;Bugman&quot; for its usage of the mission story of the same name to get Jordan Cross to come down to the ground floor. For Roulette spins like the one provided here, this can save a lot of time carrying around items and disguises.\r\rAdditionally, take out 2 NPCs that often pose problems for players on this map. Both of them roam one of the two spots Ken Morgan is frequently isolated in after making him sick: the Restaurant Bathroom and the Stock Room.",
